_:nb07ad4a6ab4b4c50991404f421668330b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
_:nb10940d51c2a4a99a75efc30b3ed5625b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
_:nb07ad4a6ab4b4c50991404f421668330b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The reference formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) defines how to\r\n        reference to elements of the data of the input source.\r\n        " .
_:ne0c701eafeb148b0bca152b2e99cef4fb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
_:na0c338181fb84d53b20a485fc28d2ec5b16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:object must be an IRI and be provided once.\n        " .
_:n978ea126980b4ed1acd4097239fd56dab12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An IRI reference for use as subject for all generated RDF triples.\n        " .
