<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLXPathReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    A structured XPath reference formulation must be typed\n    rml:XPathReferenceFormulation, and MAY specify zero or more\n    rml:namespace properties.\n    " .
_:n64fb00e6f9a44619a54b0d6e23553081b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:na0c338181fb84d53b20a485fc28d2ec5b14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:na0c338181fb84d53b20a485fc28d2ec5b15 .
